OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAreas of cloud will affect
OL,6,Fwestern parts of the region on
OL,7,FWednesday, thick enough at first to
OL,8,Fgive patchy drizzle and some fog over
OL,9,Fthe hills. The east will see the best
OL,10,Fof the sunshine, and turning quite hot
OL,11,Fhere.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FSome sunshine to end the day
OL,14,Fin the east, though cloudier further
OL,15,Fwest, and cloud generally feeding
OL,16,Facross the region from the northwest
OL,17,Fovernight. Patchy drizzle by the
OL,18,Fmorning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
