OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FThursday morning will be
OL,6,Fcloudy with the odd spot of rain.
OL,7,FSkies will brighten from the northwest
OL,8,Fin the afternoon leaving a mostly fine
OL,9,Fevening. Fresh in gentle northwesterly
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFriday
OL,13,Fand the weekend will hold onto a
OL,14,Ffresher feel. However, with high
OL,15,Fpressure building back across the
OL,16,Fregion it will be largely dry with
OL,17,Fsome warm sunshine at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
